  "releaseNotes": "Adds opt-in remembered browser sessions through rememberMe=true on the login endpoint. The framework-protected OIDC state carries the choice; the persistent cookie and encrypted Redis session share a fixed 30-day lifetime by default. Ordinary session cookies and existing idle and absolute limits remain the default.",
